Just a little girl, only 16 years old, isn't this something miraculous, wielding her weapons as though they weighed nothing at all? Indeed, she seems to have been raised for just such a moment, so strong she is and resolute. Her enemies stumble in flight before her Not one of them can stand up to her And all this she does before the gaze of the world She drives her foes out of France She recaptures castles and towns Never has anyone seen such formidable deeds
